# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Saga Ch I trigger — first lore counter added via draw-step auto-
#   increment, Ch I ability appears on the stack with chapter-specific grpId
#   (L2 fix verification). Scope-doc §2a + §3 L2.
# Forcing: saga pre-seeded on BF with 0 lore counters (no Counters modifier).
#   Turn 2 draw step fires CounterAdded → trigger Ch I. Nothing else happens.
# AI behavior: empty board, empty hand. Passes turn 1 instantly.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN + assertions pass        = L1 (lore→108) + L2 (chapter grpId) + L4
#                                   (draw-step increment) all working
#   WIN but AIC.grpId == 79552   = L2 fix regressed — still using saga grpId
#   WIN but no CounterAdded      = L4 broken — draw-step didn't increment
#   TIMEOUT                      = Ch I trigger chain stalled on stack (L5 ordering?)
# Card roles:
#   Tribute to Horobi — chapter grpIds known from card-spec (Ch I=147926).
#   Swamp x2 — draw-step fuel.
# Protocol path: GameEventCardCounters → MechanicAnnotations.counterAdded (L1,
#   LORE→108) → ZoneTransferDetector.detectStackAbilityAppearances (Ch I trigger
#   appears) → StateMapper emits AbilityInstanceCreated → ZoneMapper.
#   addStackAbilities resolves grpId via resolveChapterAbilityGrpId (L2 fix).
# Asserted by: matchdoor/src/test/kotlin/leyline/game/SagaChapter1PuzzleTest.kt —
#   turn 2 GSM contains CounterAdded(counter_type=108, amount=1) and stack
#   gameObject of type=Ability with grpId=147926 (Ch I chapter ability).

[metadata]
Name:Saga Ch I — Tribute to Horobi
Goal:Survive
Turns:2
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Pre-seeded saga with 0 lore counters. Draw step turn 2 adds lore counter → Ch I triggers. Asserts chapter-specific ability grpId resolution.

[state]
ActivePlayer=Human
ActivePhase=Main1
HumanLife=20
AILife=20

humanbattlefield=Tribute to Horobi
humanlibrary=Swamp
ailibrary=Swamp
